      }
    },
    "✓ 此刻驱动得动——但这是重启前的暂时状态：上面那个开关已经被关掉，重启后就会失效" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Works right now — but only until this browser restarts: the switch above has been turned off, so it will stop working after a restart."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "✓ 此刻驅動得動——但這只是重新啟動前的暫時狀態：上面那個開關已經被關掉，重新啟動後就會失效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」不能用来同步歌词进度。这项功能要靠浏览器执行一小段 JavaScript 来读播放进度，而这个应用没有提供对应的脚本命令。Firefox 至今没有提供，非浏览器的应用也一样。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” can’t be used to sync lyric timing. This feature reads playback position by having the browser run a small piece of JavaScript, and this app provides no scripting command for that. Firefox has never added one, and non-browser apps don’t have one either."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」不能用來同步歌詞進度。這項功能要靠瀏覽器執行一小段 JavaScript 來讀播放進度，而這個 App 沒有提供對應的指令碼命令。Firefox 至今沒有提供，非瀏覽器的 App 也一樣。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
