    "含账号凭据，不要发给别人；要连外观、快捷键一起搬走，用「备份与迁移」" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Contains account credentials — don't share it. To bring appearance and shortcuts along, use Backup & Migrate."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
