        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "匯出診斷…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在歌词一格的最左或最右放一枚菜单栏图标，图标颜色从下往上涨表示播放进度：涨上来的用「已唱到」色，其余用「未唱到」色。只在显示歌词时出现。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puts a menu bar icon at the far left or right of the lyrics slot; its color rises from the bottom to show playback progress — the risen part in Sung Color, the rest in Unsung Color. Only appears while lyrics are showing."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在歌词一格的最左或最右放一枚菜单栏图标，图标颜色从下往上涨表示播放进度：涨上来的用「已唱到」色，其余用「未唱到」色。只在显示歌词时出现。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在歌詞一格的最左或最右放一枚選單列圖像，圖像顏色從下往上漲表示播放進度：漲上來的用「已唱到」色，其餘用「未唱到」色。只在顯示歌詞時出現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "听到哪里才记到 Last.fm。\n50%：曲长一半、最多 4 分钟（官方规则）。\n75% / 90%：听满对应比例。\n曲终：放到结尾才记，中途切歌不记。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How far into a track before it's scrobbled to Last.fm.\n50%: half the track, capped at 4 minutes (Last.fm's rule).\n75% / 90%: that fraction of the track.\nTrack End: only when played through; skipping doesn't count."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "听到哪里才记到 Last.fm。\n50%：曲长一半、最多 4 分钟（官方规则）。\n75% / 90%：听满对应比例。\n曲终：放到结尾才记，中途切歌不记。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "聽到哪裡才記到 Last.fm。\n50%：曲長一半、最多 4 分鐘（官方規則）。\n75% / 90%：聽滿對應比例。\n曲終：播到結尾才記，中途切歌不記。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主歌词下方多一行，高度不变（两行 10pt / 9pt，「字号」不生效）。译文和罗马音显示当前句，「下一句」显示接下来那句、主行不再提前切。副行不滚动，装不下时尾部渐隐。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adds a second line under the lyric without changing the item's height (10pt / 9pt; Font Size has no effect). Translation and Romanization show the current line; Next Line shows the upcoming one and the main line no longer switches early. The second line never scrolls — its tail fades when it doesn't fit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主歌词下方多一行，高度不变（两行 10pt / 9pt，「字号」不生效）。译文和罗马音显示当前句，「下一句」显示接下来那句、主行不再提前切。副行不滚动，装不下时尾部渐隐。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主歌詞下方多一行，高度不變（兩行 10pt / 9pt，「字級」不生效）。譯文和羅馬拼音顯示目前這句，「下一句」顯示接下來那句、主行不再提前切。副行不捲動，放不下時尾端漸隱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标移到菜单栏歌词上换成「上一曲 / 播放暂停 / 下一曲」三个键，移开变回。暂停、间奏、或那一格太窄时不接管。点键以外的地方仍是打开面板。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hover over the menu bar lyrics to turn them into Previous / Play-Pause / Next; move away and the lyrics return. Doesn't take over while paused, between lines, or when the slot is too narrow. Clicking outside the three buttons still opens the panel."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鼠标移到菜单栏歌词上换成「上一曲 / 播放暂停 / 下一曲」三个键，移开变回。暂停、间奏、或那一格太窄时不接管。点键以外的地方仍是打开面板。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "滑鼠移到選單列歌詞上換成「上一曲 / 播放暫停 / 下一曲」三個鍵，移開變回。暫停、間奏、或那一格太窄時不接管。按鍵以外的地方仍是打開面板。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只影响装得下的句子。\n固定：短句也占满设定宽度，位置不变。\n自适应：短句按自己的宽度占位，这一项随句变宽变窄，旁边的图标跟着挪。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only affects lines that already fit.\nFixed: short lines still fill the set width, so the item never moves.\nAdaptive: short lines take only what they need; the item's width changes with each line and the icons beside it shift along."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只影响装得下的句子。\n固定：短句也占满设定宽度，位置不变。\n自适应：短句按自己的宽度占位，这一项随句变宽变窄，旁边的图标跟着挪。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只影響裝得下的句子。\n固定：短句也佔滿設定寬度，位置不變。\n自適應：短句按自己的寬度佔位，這一項隨句變寬變窄，旁邊的圖像跟著挪。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认跟随系统菜单栏，可在 10～16pt 间调，16pt 仍在菜单栏项高度内。拖回系统字号那一格即恢复跟随。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Follows the system menu bar by default; adjustable from 10 to 16pt, and 16pt still fits the menu bar item. Drag back to the system size to follow it again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认跟随系统菜单栏，可在 10～16pt 间调，16pt 仍在菜单栏项高度内。拖回系统字号那一格即恢复跟随。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "預設跟隨系統選單列，可在 10～16pt 間調，16pt 仍在選單列項目高度內。拖回系統字級那一格即恢復跟隨。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开：短于 30 秒的曲目也 scrobble，听过一半就记。\n关：不记（Last.fm 官方规则）。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On: tracks under 30 seconds are scrobbled too, once half-played.\nOff: they aren't (Last.fm's rule)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开：短于 30 秒的曲目也 scrobble，听过一半就记。\n关：不记（Last.fm 官方规则）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開：短於 30 秒的曲目也 scrobble，聽過一半就記。\n關：不記（Last.fm 官方規則）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里能看到已创建应用的 API Key，但看不到 Secret；丢了就用「前往申请」再建一个。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shows your existing apps and their API Key, but not the Secret; if it's lost, use Get One to create a new app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这里能看到已创建应用的 API Key，但看不到 Secret；丢了就用「前往申请」再建一个。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這裡能看到已建立應用程式的 API Key，但看不到 Secret；丟了就用「前往申請」再建一個。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动（默认）：按对唱声部在左 / 右 / 居中间切换。\n其余：忽略声部，固定在一个位置。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Automatic (default): switches between left / right / center by duet vocal part.\nOthers: ignore vocal parts and stay fixed in one position."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自动（默认）：按对唱声部在左 / 右 / 居中间切换。\n其余：忽略声部，固定在一个位置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自動（預設）：按對唱聲部在左 / 右 / 置中間切換。\n其餘：忽略聲部，固定在一個位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只影响桌面悬浮歌词和歌词窗口；灵动岛受空间所限不支持，菜单栏只能显示一行。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only affects Desktop Floating Lyrics and the Lyrics Window; Notch Lyrics has no room for it, and Menu Bar Lyrics shows a single line."
          }
        },
