    "换行（默认）：一行放不下就折到下一行，窗口跟着变高。\n滚动：每行只占一行高，放不下的横向滚动；这一句有逐字时间轴时跟着唱到哪滚到哪。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wrap (default): long lines fold onto the next line and the window grows taller.\nScroll: every line stays one line tall and the overflow scrolls sideways — following the singing when the line has word-level timings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
