    "%@ 把歌词缓存和播放队列放在受系统保护的目录里。授权后，本机已有的歌词可以直接用，还能提前解析接下来要播的歌；不授权歌词照样能联网找到。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The lyrics caches and play queues of %@ live in system-protected folders. With access, lyrics already on this Mac can be used directly and upcoming tracks can be resolved ahead of time; without it, lyrics are still found online."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
