    "启用失败，可能是权限或系统限制导致歌词引擎没能正常启动，导出诊断信息能看到具体原因，也方便反馈问题" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn't enable it — a permission or system restriction may have kept the lyrics engine from starting. Export Diagnostics shows the specific cause and makes it easier to report"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
